body:
Thanks for looking into it.

Below is a minimal OpenAPI doc to reproduce the the OpenAPI case. 

On import it sends a `POST` request, the JSON values are taken from the example and enum values defined in the OpenAPI doc (including degree and square symbols), but they are not correctly encoded and the server returns HTTP 400.
```
POST https://petstore3.swagger.io/api/v3/user HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:82.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/82.0
Pragma: no-cache
Cache-Control: no-cache
Content-Length: 146
Accept: application/json;charset=UTF-8
Content-Type: application/json;charset=UTF-8
Host: petstore3.swagger.io

{"id":10,"username":"m�","firstName":"J�hn","lastName":"James","email":"foo-bar@example.com","password":"ZAP","phone":"9999999999","userStatus":1}
```

As in the original description, when I right-click on the failed request in the "History" tab, select "Open/Resend with Request Editor...", and set there the JSON body again and send it it works:

```
{"id":10,"username":"m²","firstName":"J°hn","lastName":"James","email":"foo-bar@example.com","password":"ZAP","phone":"9999999999","userStatus":1}
```

Here's the minimal OpenAPI doc:
```
{
    "openapi": "3.0.2",
    "info": {
        "title": "ZAP Demo",
        "version": "0.0.0"
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "https://petstore3.swagger.io/api/v3"
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/user": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "user"
                ],
                "summary": "Create user",
                "operationId": "createUser",
                "requestBody": {
                    "description": "Created user object",
                    "content": {
                        "application/json;charset=UTF-8": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "default": {
                        "description": "successful operation",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json;charset=UTF-8": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "schemas": {
            "User": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "id": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "format": "int64",
                        "example": 10
                    },
                    "username": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "m²",
                            "in²"
                        ]
                    },
                    "firstName": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "J°hn"
                    },
                    "lastName": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "James"
                    },
                    "email": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "john@email.com"
                    },
                    "password": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "12345"
                    },
                    "phone": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "12345"
                    },
                    "userStatus": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "description": "User Status",
                        "format": "int32",
                        "example": 1
                    }
                },
                "xml": {
                    "name": "user"
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```
